JobRead.description:
Read shape — every operator-visible column.

``is_paused_by_health`` is computed at API time (FR-019);
``current_run_id`` is populated when a run is in flight.

ReleaseSearchRequest.description:
POST /api/v3/rom/search/release/{id}.

The query is derived server-side from the Release's parent Game;
the operator only filters indexers and toggles strict mode.

ScoreBreakdown.description:
Total + individual contributions — the "why" of a score.

``total`` MUST equal ``sum(c.value for c in contributions)``;
the pipeline + tests both enforce that invariant.
